Third-party components

ffmpeg / ffprobe (bin/ffmpeg/) are NOT part of this repository and are not
covered by this license. The launchers download a static GPLv3 build published
by BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds (https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds) and run it as a
separate process. Its license is bin/ffmpeg/LICENSE; the exact build and its
download URL are recorded in bin/ffmpeg/VERSION.txt.
